OL,3,GNEWSA20 years of Mela: Belfast's
OL,4,Amulticultural festival that keeps on
OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FBelfast's Botanic Gardens were awash
OL,8,Fwith even more colour than usual on
OL,9,FSunday, as crowds gathered to celebrate
OL,10,FMela Day - the final day of an annual
OL,11,Fcelebration of multiculturalism that
OL,12,Fhas been running in the city for twenty
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,FEstablished by Nisha Tandon in 2006,
OL,16,Fthe week-long Mela Festival involves
OL,17,Feverything from dance to music and food
OL,18,Fto art.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
