OL,3,GNEWSA20 years of Mela: Belfast's
OL,4,Amulticultural festival that keeps on
OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe common thread that ties it all
OL,8,Ftogether, however, is to be found in
OL,9,Fthe festival's name: Mela, which means
OL,10,F'uniting'.
OL,12,FTandon said the past twenty years have
OL,13,Fbeen a great journey of helping people
OL,14,Flearn about each other's cultures.
